{"3516870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chronicles of Fantasy Heroes", "steam_appid": 3516870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cross into a parallel world where you will meet over a dozen unique companions. Join forces to defeat the evils of this realm, restore peace, and uncover the truth connecting this world to reality. The question is: Can you resurrect your lost love? The answer lies in your hands! This RPG will take you on an adventure like no other.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/27dc98747836426f2cfaf876d6376989.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/27dc98747836426f2cfaf876d6376989.webp?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=107 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vast World to Roam</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten distinct regions and dozens of handcrafted levels await—no empty backtracking, no mindless fetch quests. For the RPG lover in you, every corner of this world holds something worth discovering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi-Open Storytelling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We blend the narrative depth of classic RPGs with the freedom of non-linear choice to create something uniquely ours: a semi-open story where characters matter. Every companion has a distinct personality and a personal arc that belongs to them. Your choices don’t just steer the plot—they shape their fates. Companions are not set dressing. They’re people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/ebfae8da2e0e5bed9f089e6a55a81eac.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/ebfae8da2e0e5bed9f089e6a55a81eac.avif?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/09cc02806aaf605766b52b1eacd22049.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/09cc02806aaf605766b52b1eacd22049.webp?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=107 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Combat System That Actually Fights Back</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re done with traditional turn-based tropes. Our combat fuses multiple mechanics where <strong>14 different debuffs and status ailments work on bosses from start to finish</strong>—no gimmicks, no decoration. Combine freely with item loadouts and environmental interactions, and every boss fight becomes a test of strategy, not a stat-check.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/610229f1a8bf0f71f382fd3708a43a47.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/610229f1a8bf0f71f382fd3708a43a47.avif?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/bca9cb9c4b3305b8938ad4fad7895b28.avif?t=1787650648\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/d6dc3b0a2ea8d22dd7f22fec73a8969d.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/d6dc3b0a2ea8d22dd7f22fec73a8969d.webp?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=107 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Affix System: Build Without Borders</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear and skills come loaded with rich modifiers. Mix, match, and forge a combat style that is yours alone. There is no single “best” build. There is only <i>your</i> build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/1982ae2752e2bf7ccace10194c0f9a8d.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/1982ae2752e2bf7ccace10194c0f9a8d.avif?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=816 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/92a7f49eee6833818c817bcd5e385d68.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/92a7f49eee6833818c817bcd5e385d68.webp?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=107 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weave: Nothing Is Ever Trash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our deep affix and crafting system turns scrap into strategy. Extract useful modifiers from discarded gear and socket them into your current loadout for pinpoint upgrades. Dismantle for materials, or fuse two pieces together to birth something rare and potent. Here, nothing is truly junk—only treasure that hasn’t been found yet. Forging, alchemy, and cooking aren’t just collection busywork; they feed directly into combat and exploration, producing the exact items that can turn the tide when it matters most.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/b8f509b40de2a8b689bc17ee7e5efc38.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/b8f509b40de2a8b689bc17ee7e5efc38.avif?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=816 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/1b7d67ba444114948d9baa32dec8b3d3.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/1b7d67ba444114948d9baa32dec8b3d3.webp?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=107 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Freedom, Seven Ways to Grow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character brings a fixed talent tree plus a swappable skill set you can customize on the fly. Craft unique skill builds and playstyles to your heart’s content. On top of that, seven distinct attribute growth paths let you shape your party however you want—from <strong>Berserker</strong> and <strong>Glass Cannon</strong> to <strong>Healing Master</strong> and <strong>Status Specialist</strong>. Your preference, your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/29093adeb3615f243b62de1e56135b7c.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/29093adeb3615f243b62de1e56135b7c.avif?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=808 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/4d9f6caa1dfc0fac245050aade01115f.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/4d9f6caa1dfc0fac245050aade01115f.avif?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=812 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/f35c8293d4ecf03bda4a49d63e8eeec3.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/f35c8293d4ecf03bda4a49d63e8eeec3.webp?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=107 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets That Stay Hidden</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world does not reveal itself easily. Forgotten allies, dormant powerhouses, and lost artifacts lie in wait for an adventurer curious enough to look. Will that be you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently in active development. </strong>More features and gameplay are being developed at full throttle!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/fb2269170de899f80eaf58db46feee3f.avif?t=1787650648\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cross into a parallel world where you will meet over a dozen unique companions. Join forces to defeat the evils of this realm, restore peace, and uncover the truth connecting this world to reality. The question is: Can you resurrect your lost love? The answer lies in your hands! This RPG will take you on an adventure like no other.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/27dc98747836426f2cfaf876d6376989.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/27dc98747836426f2cfaf876d6376989.webp?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=107 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vast World to Roam</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten distinct regions and dozens of handcrafted levels await—no empty backtracking, no mindless fetch quests. For the RPG lover in you, every corner of this world holds something worth discovering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Semi-Open Storytelling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We blend the narrative depth of classic RPGs with the freedom of non-linear choice to create something uniquely ours: a semi-open story where characters matter. Every companion has a distinct personality and a personal arc that belongs to them. Your choices don’t just steer the plot—they shape their fates. Companions are not set dressing. They’re people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/ebfae8da2e0e5bed9f089e6a55a81eac.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/ebfae8da2e0e5bed9f089e6a55a81eac.avif?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/09cc02806aaf605766b52b1eacd22049.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/09cc02806aaf605766b52b1eacd22049.webp?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=107 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Combat System That Actually Fights Back</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re done with traditional turn-based tropes. Our combat fuses multiple mechanics where <strong>14 different debuffs and status ailments work on bosses from start to finish</strong>—no gimmicks, no decoration. Combine freely with item loadouts and environmental interactions, and every boss fight becomes a test of strategy, not a stat-check.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/610229f1a8bf0f71f382fd3708a43a47.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/610229f1a8bf0f71f382fd3708a43a47.avif?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/bca9cb9c4b3305b8938ad4fad7895b28.avif?t=1787650648\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/d6dc3b0a2ea8d22dd7f22fec73a8969d.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/d6dc3b0a2ea8d22dd7f22fec73a8969d.webp?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=107 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Affix System: Build Without Borders</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear and skills come loaded with rich modifiers. Mix, match, and forge a combat style that is yours alone. There is no single “best” build. There is only <i>your</i> build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/1982ae2752e2bf7ccace10194c0f9a8d.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/1982ae2752e2bf7ccace10194c0f9a8d.avif?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=816 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/92a7f49eee6833818c817bcd5e385d68.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/92a7f49eee6833818c817bcd5e385d68.webp?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=107 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weave: Nothing Is Ever Trash</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our deep affix and crafting system turns scrap into strategy. Extract useful modifiers from discarded gear and socket them into your current loadout for pinpoint upgrades. Dismantle for materials, or fuse two pieces together to birth something rare and potent. Here, nothing is truly junk—only treasure that hasn’t been found yet. Forging, alchemy, and cooking aren’t just collection busywork; they feed directly into combat and exploration, producing the exact items that can turn the tide when it matters most.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/b8f509b40de2a8b689bc17ee7e5efc38.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/b8f509b40de2a8b689bc17ee7e5efc38.avif?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=816 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/1b7d67ba444114948d9baa32dec8b3d3.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/1b7d67ba444114948d9baa32dec8b3d3.webp?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=107 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill Freedom, Seven Ways to Grow</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character brings a fixed talent tree plus a swappable skill set you can customize on the fly. Craft unique skill builds and playstyles to your heart’s content. On top of that, seven distinct attribute growth paths let you shape your party however you want—from <strong>Berserker</strong> and <strong>Glass Cannon</strong> to <strong>Healing Master</strong> and <strong>Status Specialist</strong>. Your preference, your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/29093adeb3615f243b62de1e56135b7c.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/29093adeb3615f243b62de1e56135b7c.avif?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=808 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/4d9f6caa1dfc0fac245050aade01115f.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/4d9f6caa1dfc0fac245050aade01115f.avif?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=812 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/f35c8293d4ecf03bda4a49d63e8eeec3.avif?t=1787650648\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras_big/f35c8293d4ecf03bda4a49d63e8eeec3.webp?t=1787650648 width=1560 height=107 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets That Stay Hidden</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world does not reveal itself easily. Forgotten allies, dormant powerhouses, and lost artifacts lie in wait for an adventurer curious enough to look. Will that be you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Currently in active development. </strong>More features and gameplay are being developed at full throttle!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/extras/fb2269170de899f80eaf58db46feee3f.avif?t=1787650648\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p>", "short_description": "If you enjoy 3D turn-based RPG, gridless tactics, light roguelite, open-world exploration, hidden treasures, bosses, quests, monster catching, secret companions, deep character builds, and unique battle mechanics – then this is the game for you! A fresh turn-based RPG experience!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/f7744f46863089c0ef68588a4ada210c685d2c0a/header.jpg?t=1787650648", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/e199f4d8db25e5538aeee1e6e07a0165a0cbd6e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787650648", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516870/e199f4d8db25e5538aeee1e6e07a0165a0cbd6e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787650648", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10,11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5-3470 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</str